  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>, each phosphorus undergo&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;hybridisation. It has one P-O-P linkage in it.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0025_bcdbecac079a.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 155px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>HPO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0025_007dcaeb5a1a.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 236px;\" /></p><p>In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>HPO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math>, each phosphorus undergo&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;hybridisation. It has three&nbsp;P-O-P linkages in it.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0025_dff925a41d20.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 212px;\" /></p><p>In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math>, each phosphorus undergo&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;hybridisation. It has six&nbsp;P-O-P linkages in it.</p>"
